        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BDSS40, 4 Inch Modern Square Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Square Baseboard Door Bumper is available in an array of modern finishes. This Contemporary Square Door Stop is so easy to install, it just screws into the baseboard or door. Most people do not notice the lowly door stopper, but the 4 Inch Modern Square Door Stop with its chic appearance just might fetch a few compliments--it's that stunning. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDSS40-specifications.gif?v=1704354776\" width\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BDSS40 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BDSS40 Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BDSS40-specifications.pdf?v=1691095330\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BDSS40 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
