                "description": "The 4 Inch Square Baseboard Door Bumper is available in an array of modern finishes. This Contemporary Square Door Stop is so easy to install, it just screws into the baseboard or door. Most people do not notice the lowly door stopper, but the 4 Inch Modern Square Door Stop with its chic appearance just might fetch a few compliments.",
